  "goodToKnow": "Wackeln means to wobble or shake: Der Stuhl wackelt, mit dem Kopf wackeln. A loose child's tooth is ein Wackelzahn. Figuratively, Sein Job wackelt means it's uncertain, and der Wackelkandidat is someone whose place is in doubt, from a team player to a coalition partner. Der Wackelpudding is jelly (Jell-O), and wackelig means wobbly. Regular: wackelte, gewackelt."
